# Production only: the full URL of the deployed backend (Render), with NO
# trailing slash. Set this in Vercel's Environment Variables (it is baked into
# the build). Example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://zyadcoin-backend.onrender.com
#
# Leave this UNSET for local development — the Vite dev server proxies /api to
# http://localhost:3001 instead (see vite.config.ts).
VITE_API_URL=
